        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D0806TA-MS Traditional Max Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's line of auxiliary deadbolt kits has many features which ensure a product of high security and style. The traditional styled exterior collar is made of forged solid brass. The interiors have large oval turnpieces which are both traditionally designed and easy to operate. The 1\" deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforcement strike plate with 3\" long screws for additional security.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia Max-Steel finish will change the way you think about stainless steel. The unique process in the manufacturing provides a superior resistance to tarnishing and pitting. Max Steel is a PVD <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> coating that is highly resistant to extreme elements. It has a lifetime <b>No Tarnish Guarantee</b>. Recommended for harsh environments such as salty air.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFits standard 2-1/8\" door prep. Deadbolt kit includes lock cylinder with collar, deadbolt assembly, faceplate and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D0806TA-MS Traditional Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Available with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Available for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Max Steel <b>PVD Satin Stainless Steel Finish</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued</b>. See available <a href=\"/collections/omnia-deadbolts-and-privacy-bolts\"><b>Omnia Deadbolts</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
