                "description": "Omnia D0806TA-MS Traditional Max-Steel single cylinder deadbolt - Omnia's line of auxiliary deadbolt kits has many features which ensure a product of high security and style. The traditional styled exterior collar is made of forged solid brass. The interiors have large oval turnpieces which are both traditionally designed and easy to operate. The 1 inch deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforcement strike plate with 3 inch long screws for additional security.\r\n",
